Description: A mechanistic QSP model of Hantavirus infection dynamics,
    innate immune response, endothelial permeability, organ-specific injury
    (renal and pulmonary), and antiviral pharmacokinetics/pharmacodynamics
    for Ribavirin and Favipiravir. Includes virtual population generation
    (N=1000), 4-arm virtual trial simulation, and treatment-window analysis.
